{
    "title": "Hole19 Golf GPS & Range Finder",
    "description": "Hole19 is the FREE golf GPS app that provides accurate yardages, scoring for you and your friends, and live leaderboards.\r\n\r\nDon't waste money on expensive golf equipment like rangefinders or fancy golf GPS gadgets! Hole19 is the best golf GPS app that provides accurate distances everywhere on the course and keeps your rounds stored in one place. With over 43,000 golf courses available, Hole19 is THE golf app that works with Wear OS!\r\n\r\n\"I've been using Hole19 for a few years now, and it's been great to see my game improve tremendously. I used to shoot over 100, and now it's fantastic to see an average in the mid-80s.\" - S. Mun from Australia.\r\n\r\n\"For a truly high-tech golfing app, check out Hole19.\" -The New York Times.\r\n\r\nHole19 offers golf advice that can help you enhance your game. Compatible with the latest Android 9+ phones and WearOS devices*.\r\n* You also have access to Tiles and Complications\r\n\r\n<b>FREE DOWNLOAD FEATURES:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>GPS Rangefinder:</b> Accurately measure shot distances to the front, back, and center of the green on over 43,000 golf courses from around the world, with our rangefinder.</li>\r\n<li><b>Digital Golf Scorecard:</b> Track your score during every round in the golf scorecard and save every golf shot you take in one place. Stableford and Stroke Play scoring systems are currently available.</li>\r\n<li><b>Discover Courses:</b> Use our course ratings and reviews to find the best golf courses to play.</li>\r\n<li><b>Live Leaderboards:</b> Use Hole19-LIVE and compete in real-time with other golfers on the app.</li>\r\n<li><b>Share With Friends:</b> Hole19 is a social golf app; share your progress and your love of the game with our active community of golf enthusiasts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>TAKE STROKES OFF YOUR GAME WITH PREMIUM PRO</b>\r\nFor less than $5 per month, you can upgrade to Hole19 Premium and benefit from score-lowering features like:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Handicap Calculator:</b> Calculate and receive a more accurate handicap that enables you to compete with golfers of all skill levels.</li>\r\n<li><b>Club Recommendation:</b> Get real-time club recommendations based on your personal distances.</li>\r\n<li><b>Match Play:</b> Challenge your friends to a match play game and easily track your scores in the golf scorecard.</li>\r\n<li><b>Shot Tracker:</b> Know how accurate and how far you hit each club using the Shot Tracker feature and Shot-by-Shot input.</li>\r\n<li><b>Distance Tracker (Watch):</b> Quickly & easily measure the distance of your last shot.</li>\r\n<li><b>Overall Statistics:</b> Get performance statistics on your driving accuracy, greens in regulation, short game, and putting.</li>\r\n<li><b>Golf Advice:</b> Receive valuable golf advice to improve your game & lower your scores.</li>\r\n<li><b>Club Statistics:</b> Know exactly how far you hit your shots with each club when using the Advanced Input. Now you can see the average and maximum distance per club in your bag, including accuracy.</li>\r\n<li><b>Auto-change Hole:</b> No need to change holes on your app. Walk from green to tee, and your Hole19 App will change holes automatically.</li>\r\n<li><b>Premium Maps:</b> See the course & your shots even more clearly with improved resolution Premium golf course maps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Highlights:</b> See the highlights of your golf career summarized in one place. Best Hole, Best Score and Most Played Course.</li>\r\n<li><b>Watch Scoring</b>\r\n</li><li><b>No Ads:</b> Enjoy an ad-free experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nhelp@hole19golf.com: For technical questions and FAQs\r\nmapping@hole19golf.com: For mapping requests\r\npartners@hole19golf.com: Promote your brand with us\r\nPremium features are available through in-app purchasing\r\nHole19 Privacy Policy: https://www.hole19golf.com/terms/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.hole19golf.com/terms\r\n\r\nPlease note: We no longer support devices using Android 8 operating systems or below.\r\n \r\nHole19 also provides valuable golf advice to help you improve your game. Download the app & enhance your golfing experience.",
